{"title":"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 32","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_32\">Problem 32</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 32\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the discriminant of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/d/c1dcad3b00f1dbf80524f263bcd6238dde91f06a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2+2bx+c=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"140\" height=\"16\" /> is zero, then another true statement about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/3/3834f0cef2a1f4d8524aa5bc8e3faca298550862.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"25\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> is that: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/d/1ad1e6def810e6e9eeb2670469392fd7fe7831ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{they form an arithmetic progression}\\\\ \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{they form a geometric progression}\\\\ \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{they are unequal}\\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{they are all negative numbers}\\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{only b is negative and a and c are positive}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"341\" height=\"96\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The discriminant of a quadratic is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/f/18f66939ff370dbad58d7fc434a85fc568b611d2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Delta = b^2 - 4ac = (2b)^2 - 4ac = 4b^2 - 4ac = 0.\\]\" width=\"348\" height=\"19\" />\nWe know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/c/d1c3c2ee8c4349a3d97e62a6d062146a4ecec004.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2 = ac,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/2/db2c47aac4ac699b8c3eb7b473987514d1f31cd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{b}{a} = \\frac{c}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"48\" height=\"37\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/acc6d9a6172d35127b6cb37ea92192caf7029a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> form a geometric progression.\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/b/69bb65d8b09333c4d5a11be52f4f7df860510d21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"36\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME\" title=\"1955 AHSME\">1955 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1955 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.c